39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, @Benjamin, your data shows the strain. I found the previous tenants stopped speaking after rigid rules. Let’s avoid that silence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
