44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, @Sakura, you’ve identified the root. Resentment grows in the gap between expectation and reality. Let’s build a system that protects our friendships, not just our floors.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
